\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. To God be the Glory! great things 
\par He hath done!
\par So loved He the world that 
\par He gave us His Son;
\par Who yielded His life an atonement for sin,
\par And opened the Life gate 
\par that all may go in.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Praise the Lord! praise the Lord!
\par Let the earth hear His voice!
\par Praise the Lord! praise the Lord!
\par Let the people rejoice!
\par O come to the Father, through
\par Jesus the Son:
\par And give Him the glory!
\par Great things He hath done!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O perfect redemption, 
\par the purchase of blood!
\par To every believer the promise of God;
\par The vilest offender who truly believes,
\par That moment from Jesus a pardon receives.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Praise the Lord! praise the Lord!
\par Let the earth hear His voice!
\par Praise the Lord! praise the Lord!
\par Let the people rejoice!
\par O come to the Father, through
\par Jesus the Son:
\par And give Him the glory!
\par Great things He hath done!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Great things He hath taught us,
\par great things He hath done,
\par And great our rejoicing through 
\par Jesus the Son;
\par But purer, and higher, and greater will be
\par Our wonder, our rapture, when
\par Jesus we see.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Praise the Lord! praise the Lord!
\par Let the earth hear His voice!
\par Praise the Lord! praise the Lord!
\par Let the people rejoice!
\par O come to the Father, through
\par Jesus the Son:
\par And give Him the glory!
\par Great things He hath done!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

